# Grouped shop invoices

Shop orders can now be billed together, by month, quarter, or year, instead of one invoice per order.

Set the period in the [shop settings](/settings#shop) for everyone, or only on the members who need it. This is handy for [restaurants or professional buyers](/handbook/shop#restaurants) who order every week. The invoice still lists each order, with its products.

Those orders stay "to be prepared" until the morning after the period ends, then share one invoice. You can also invoice the period earlier, from the order. Leave the period blank to keep invoicing each order on its own.
